      "writtenOn": "2023-11-10T15:04:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is a truly GPUOnly buffer but Dawn/WebGPU use a transfer to populate it. This is why it can\u0027t be later remapped: the first mapping isn\u0027t a true mapping of the real buffer.\n\nAfter off-issue discussion we decided to make this a WASM-only behavior for now. Let Graphite handle the transfer buffer on native. As work on the bug proceeds this can behavior can become used when on a \"non-yielding\" context that doesn\u0027t support synchronous maps. For native this will likely only be a testing config that will allow testing of \"webgpu sans asyncify\" behavior.",
